WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.250
Ryu descends toward Elena with jumping heavy punch.

2
00:00:04.250 --> 00:00:06.250
Shin Hashogeki launches Elena into the corner juggle.

3
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.850
A raw Drive Rush crouching heavy punch keeps Elena airborne.

4
00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:08.550
Heavy High Blade Kick extends the corner juggle.

5
00:00:08.550 --> 00:00:09.650
Light Shoryuken completes the juggle.

6
00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:10.050
Elena falls at the corner after the final Shoryuken.
